    "Choose isMatch for a Boolean, find for the first match record, or findAll for all non-overlapping matches. split keeps the pieces between matches. replaceAll inserts literal text; replaceAllWith receives a match record to compute replacement text. escape makes user text a literal pattern fragment.",
